# Context override on a CHARACTERISTIC target — a recorded besluit-6 flank

Besluit 6's generated top rung (implemented) covers a context override on an
ATTRIBUTE target: the §4.1 hardship-pattern shape is a decided *value* riding
above the callee's own ladder. A context override on a *characteristic*
(boolean) callee target — a decided attribution rather than a value — is not
wired: it stays refused loudly, the narrowed remnant of the old blanket
context refusal.

```catala
declaration scope Kamer:
  input grondslag content integer
  context vrijgesteld content boolean
  output uitkomst content boolean

scope Kamer:
  definition vrijgesteld equals grondslag < 50
  definition uitkomst equals vrijgesteld

declaration scope Aanslag:
  input grondslag content integer
  input zet_vrij content boolean
  kamer scope Kamer
  output resultaat content boolean

scope Aanslag:
  definition kamer.grondslag equals grondslag
  definition kamer.vrijgesteld under condition zet_vrij consequence equals true
  definition resultaat equals kamer.uitkomst
```
